ORGANIZATIONAL TECHNICAL DEVELOPMENT PLAN

Objective
- Implement organization-based multi-user architecture in Builder with minimal disruption to existing user_id flows.
- Keep integration catalog creation Super Admin-only.
- Let organizations manage integration instances (credentials/config), not catalog types.
- Support expandable roles via Role CRUD with strict governance (Super Admin controls role templates).

Scope (Builder Repo)
- Organization provisioning (Super Admin).
- Team management (Org Admin/Manager): invite, activate, soft-delete sub-users.
- Org-scoped content access: angles, templates, pages, API instances, OTP/pixels where applicable.
- Cross-org move/clone by Super Admin with mandatory audit logs.
- Integration UX grouping: Network APIs / Pixels / Services.

Out of Scope
- CRM internal schema/engine for caps/rules/schedules/invoices.
- Billing/payment hold automation.
- Long-term retention/force-delete policy.

