PHASE 0: DESIGN LOCK (1-2 days)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Deliverables
- Final permission matrix (Super Admin, Org Admin, Org Manager, Media Buyer).
- Soft-delete cascade matrix (exact tables and rules).
- CRM contract addendum (org_id and user scope fields).
- Role governance lock:
  - Super Admin: role.create / role.update / role.archive / role.view.
  - Org Admin: role.assign + permission.matrix.view + permission.matrix.update.
  - Org Manager: role.assign + permission.matrix.view; permission.matrix.update only when explicitly delegated by Org Admin.
  - Org Admin/Manager: no role CRUD (create/update/archive roles remains Super Admin-only).
  - Media Buyer: no role management.

